<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">RRK27.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">DANIELI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Danieli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Danieli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dan</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">DANIELI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Danieli na bagyenzi be okwanga kweshiisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Bag 24:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kashatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda, Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni akateera Yerusaalemu, yaagigota. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:2">Dan 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:13">2 Bag 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 5:14">Ezr 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Mukama yaahayo Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda omu mikono ye, hamwe n'ebintu bimwe eby'omu nju ya Ruhanga; Nebukadeneeza yaabitwara Shinaari, yaabita omu ibiikiro ry'omuri hekalu ya ruhanga we. <verse eid="DAN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:18">2 Bag 20:18</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaaragiira Ashipenazi omukuru w'abakonwa be kureeta bamwe aha batsigazi b'omu Baisraeli, ab'omu ruganda rw'abagabe n'orw'abakungu, <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />abatsigazi abataine kamogo, abarungi, abaine obwengye omu by'emyoga byona, abaine okumanya kwingi, abarikwetegyereza omu by'okwega, kandi abarikubaasa kuheereza omu kikaari ky'omugabe, ngu abeegyese obwengye bw'Abakaludaaya n'orurimi rwabo. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Atyo omugabe yaabateeraho omugabo gwa buri izooba gw'eby'okurya ebi yaabaire aryaho, na viinyo ei yaabaire anywaho, kumara emyaka eshatu nibariisibwa gye, ngu aha muheru gwayo babone kwemerera omu maisho g'omugabe. <verse eid="DAN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Omuri abo hakaba harimu Danieli, Hanania, Mishaeli na Azaria ab'omu ruganda rwa Yuda. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:12">Dan 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:34">2 Bag 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:17">24:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ogwo mukuru w'abakonwa yaabakubya agandi maziina; Danieli yaamweta Beliteeshaza, Hanania yaamweta Seduraaka, Mishaeli yaamweta Mesaaki, na Azaria yaamweta Abedeneego.<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Kwonka Danieli yaamariirira omu mutima gwe okuteeshiisha n'eby'okurya by'omugabe, n'obu yaakuba viinyo ei yaabaire anywa; nikyo yaayeshengyerereize omukuru w'abakonwa ngu amwikirize, arekye kweshiisha. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:21">Kut 39:21</ref>; <ref loc="EST 2:9">Est 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:46">Zab 106:46</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:7">Enf 16:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ruhanga yaaha Danieli okugirirwa embabazi n'esaasi omu maisho g'ogwo mukuru w'abakonwa. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />Omukuru w'abakonwa yaagira Danieli ati: Nintiina mukama wangye omugabe, owaabateereireho eby'okurya n'eby'okunywa, atakaashanga muhundamire okukira abatsigazi abu murikwingana nabo, mukantemesaho omutwe. <verse eid="DAN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Bwanyima Danieli yaashaba omugabuzi, owaabaire atairweho omukuru w'abakonwa kureeberera Danieli ogwo Hanania, Mishaeli na Azaria, ati: <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:10">Kush 2:10</ref>. </char></note> Ninkweshengyereza otugyeze, tumare ebiro ikumi niturya ebihimba, kandi nitunywa amaizi. <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Bwanyima otureebe, otushushanise n'abandi batsigazi abarikurya aha by'okurya by'omugabe; haza oku oraareebe, obe nikwo waatwaza abairu baawe. <verse eid="DAN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />Atyo yaabahurira, yaikiriza kumara ebiro ikumi naabagyeza, ahabw'ekyo eki baashaba. <verse eid="DAN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />Aha muheru gw'ebyo biro ikumi yaashanga nibareebeka gye, kandi bagomokire okukira abatsigazi boona, abaabaire nibarya aha by'okurya by'omugabe. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo ogwo mugabuzi yaabaiha ahari ebyo by'okurya ebi baabaire nibaragiirwa kurya, na viinyo ei baabaire nibaragiirwa kunywa, yaaguma naabaha ebihimba.<verse eid="DAN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:23">Dan 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:12">5:12</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:5">Yak 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abo batsigazi bana Ruhanga yaabaha okumanya n'okuba abahangu omuri byona ebi barikwega n'omu bwengye; kandi Danieli we yaagira okwetegyereza omu by'okworekwa byona n'omu by'okushoboorora ebirooto. <verse eid="DAN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />Obunaku, obu omugabe Nebukadeneeza yaaragiire kubareeteramu, ku bwahikire, omukuru w'abakonwa yaabareeta kubamumurikira. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Ku baahikire aho, omugabe yaagaaniira nabo; kwonka omu bandi boona tiharabonekiremu owaabaire ari nka Danieli, Hanania, Mishaeli na Azaria; nikyo baabeereire ab'okuheereza omugabe. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:27">Dan 2:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:24">Kut 41:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu bigambo byona eby'obwengye n'eby'okwetegyereza, akashanga nibakira abafumu n'abarogi boona, abaabaire bari omu bugabe bwe bwona emirundi ikumi. <verse eid="DAN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:28">Dan 6:28</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:1">10:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:28">Isa 44:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:1">45:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Danieli yaaguma aho okuhitsya omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwa Kuuro.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Danieli okurootororera omugabe ekirooto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 4:5">Dan 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:8">Kut 41:8</ref>; <ref loc="EST 6:1">Est 6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kabiri Nebukadeneeza aherize kuza aha ngoma, akaroota ebirooto, byamureetera kwemereza omutima, yaabura oturo. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:20">Dan 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10">Bir 18:10</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:9">Isa 47:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 47:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe yaaragiira ku baamwetera abafumu, abahi b'engisha, abarogi n'Abakaludaaya, ngu barootorore ebi arootsire. Batyo baija, baayemerera omu maisho g'omugabe. <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />Yaabagira ati: Ndootsire ekirooto; ahabw'okwenda kukimanya kyandeetera kwemereza omutima. <verse eid="DAN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:31">1 Bag 1:31</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 2:3">Neh 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Batyo Abakaludaaya baagira omugabe bati: Karamaare, Nyakusinga! Gambira abairu baawe ekyo kirooto, tubone kukikushobororera. <verse eid="DAN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:29">Dan 3:29</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:11">Ezr 6:11</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagarukamu Abakaludaaya ati: Eki ngamba tikihinduka; ku muraabe mutakindootororeire, mukanshobororera amakuru gaakyo, nimwija kutemagurwa, n'amaka gaanyu gahindurwe orubungo. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:7">Dan 5:7</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku murakindootororere n'amakuru gaakyo, niinyija kubaha ebiconco, n'ebihembo kandi n'ekitiinisa kingi. Mbwenu mpaho, nimukinshobororere n'amakuru gaakyo. <verse eid="DAN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />Baamugarukamu obwa kabiri bati: Nyakusinga naagambire abairu be ekyo kirooto, naitwe nitwija kukimushobororera. <verse eid="DAN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Omugabe yaabagarukamu ati: Nimmanyira kimwe ku murikwenda kumara omwanya gwa busha, ahakuba nimumanya ngu eki naagamba nikwo kiri; <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />ku muraabe mutandootororeire eki kirooto, hariho ekigambo kimwe kyonka eki ndikwija kubakora. Mugiire omu naama kumbeiha n'okugambira ebitahikire omu maisho gangye, okuhitsya obu ebintu biraahindukye. Mbwenu nimungambire eki ndootsire, mbone kumanya ku murikubaasa n'okunshobororera amakuru gaakyo. <verse eid="DAN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Abakaludaaya baagarukamu omugabe bati: Tihariho muntu n'omwe omu nsi owaakubaasa kugambira omugabe ekyo kigambo; ahabw'okuba tihariho mugabe, n'obu yaakuba mukuru kandi ow'amaani ata, orabuurize omufumu weena, omurogi weena, nari Omukaludaaya weena ekigambo nk'ekyo. <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:11">Dan 5:11</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Eki omugabe arikubuuza kigumire, tihariho orikubaasa kukishobororera omugabe kureka baaruhanga, abatatuura mu bantu.<verse eid="DAN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:16">Mat 2:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo kyareetera omugabe kuguubwa kubi n'okugira ekiniga kingi; atyo yaaragiira kucwekyereza abanyabwengye b'omuri Babulooni boona. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:4-7">Dan 1:4-7</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ekiragiro kyashohozibwa kwita abanyabwengye boona, baasherura Danieli na bagyenzi be kubaita. <verse eid="DAN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Bwanyima Arioki omukuru w'abarinzi b'omugabe, owaagiire kwita abanyabwengye b'omuri Babulooni, ku yaahikire Danieli, Danieli yaamugarukisamu obwengye n'okwerinda, <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />naagira ati: Ahabw'enki omugabe ashohoize ekiragiro ekirikushaarira kiti? Atyo Arioki yaakishobororera Danieli. <verse eid="DAN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Ahonaaho Danieli yaaza ow'omugabe, yaamushaba kumuha obunaku, obu araizireho kumushobororera amakuru g'ekyo kirooto.<verse eid="DAN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Bwanyima Danieli yaataaha omu nju ye, yaabimanyisa bagyenzi be Hanania, Mishaeli na Azaria, <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:7">Kut 24:7</ref>. </char></note> yaabagambira kushaba Ruhanga ow'omu iguru kubagirira embabazi, akabashuuruurira ekyo kigambo, ngu we na bagyenzi be barekye kucwekyerezibwa n'abandi banyabwengye b'omuri Babulooni. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:6">Kub 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:15">Yob 33:15</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 33:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:13">Kush 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:11">16:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho ekyo kigambo kyashuuruurirwa Danieli nyekiro omu kworekwa. Danieli nikwo kusiima Ruhanga ow'omu iguru, <verse eid="DAN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:10">1 Bus 29:10</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:5">Neh 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:13">Yob 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:68">Luk 1:68</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:12">Kush 5:12</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:20">Eiziina rya Ruhanga rihimbisibwe ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:20">Ahabw'okuba obwengye n'obushoboorozi n'ebye.<verse eid="DAN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:18">Yob 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 75:7">Zab 75:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:6">Enf 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:17">Dan 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:20">5:20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:7">Byak 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:1">Rom 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:5">Yak 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe ahindura obunaku n'emyaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">Niwe aihaho, abagabe, akataho abandi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">Aha abanyabwengye obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">N'abarikwetegyereza abaha okumanya;<verse eid="DAN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:22">Yob 12:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:12">Zab 139:12</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:16">1 Tim 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:17">Yak 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:5">1 Yoh 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ashuuruura ebya hare ebitarikumanywa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:22">Amanya ebiri omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:22">Kandi n'omushana gutuura nawe.<verse eid="DAN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 26:7">Bir 26:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai Ruhanga wa baatatenkuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">Ninkusiima, kandi ninkuhimbisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">Ahabw'okuba wampa obwengye n'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">Kandi hati wanshobororera ebi twakushaba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">Ahakuba waatumanyisa eki omugabe arikufa.<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />N'ahabw'ekyo Danieli yaaza owa Arioki, ou omugabe yaabaire aragiire kucwekyereza abanyabwengye b'omuri Babulooni, yaamugira ati: Otacwekyereza abanyabwengye b'omuri Babulooni; kureka ontwara ow'omugabe, mmushobororere amakuru g'ekirooto. <verse eid="DAN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Atyo Arioki yaarahuka, yaatwara Danieli aha mugabe, yaamugira ati: Ndeebire omushaija w'omu Bayuda abaanyagirwe, orikubaasa kushobororera omugabe ekirooto kye. <verse eid="DAN 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:7">Dan 1:7</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaabuuza Danieli orikwetwa Beliteeshaza, ati: Iwe, noobaasa kungambira eki ndootsire n'amakuru gaakyo? <verse eid="DAN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:7">Dan 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Danieli yaagarukamu omugabe ati: Omu banyabwengye, nari abarogi, nari abafumu, n'obu haakuba omu barikuragura eby'enyonyoozi, tiharimu n'omwe orikubaasa kushobororera omugabe ekitarikumanywa eki arikubuuza; <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:10">1 Kor 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 2:11">11</ref>. </char></note> kureka hariho Ruhanga omu iguru, oshuuruura ebitarikumanywa, kandi niwe amanyiise omugabe Nebukadeneeza ebiribaho omu biro ebiriija. Ekirooto kyawe n'ebi oyorekirwe obyami aha kitanda kyawe nibyo ebi. <verse eid="DAN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />Nyakusinga, ku obaire obyami aha kitanda kyawe, waizirwa ebiteekateeko by'ebiribaho omu biro ebiriija; Oshuuruura ebitarikumanywa niwe akumanyiise ebiribaho. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:16">Kut 41:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nyowe ahabwangye timbishuuruuriirwe ahabw'okuba omunyabwengye okukira abandi boona, kureka ngu omugabe amanyisibwe amakuru gaabyo, kandi amanye ebiteekateeko by'omu mutima gwe.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />Nyakusinga, ku ogiire kugira oti, waareeba ekishushani kihango. Ekyo kishushani rutaaba ekirikumurinkana kyarumbaara omu maisho gaawe, kandi okureebeka kwakyo kubaire nikutiinisa. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Omutwe gw'ekyo kishushani gubaire guri ogw'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, ekifuba kyakyo n'emikono yaakyo biri eby'efeeza, enda yaakyo n'ebibero byakyo biri eby'emiringa, <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />amaguru gaakyo gari ag'ekyoma, kandi ebigyere byakyo bibaire biri ekyoma n'eibumba. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:44">Mat 21:44</ref>. </char></note> Ku obaire nookikyetegyereza, haatimbirayo eibaare, eritahigwirwe muntu, ryateera ebigyere by'ekyo kishushani eby'ekyoma n'eibumba, ryabyatagura; <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:11">Kush 20:11</ref>. </char></note> ahonaaho ekyoma, eibumba, emiringa, efeeza n'ezaabu byayatagurikira kimwe, byahinduka nk'omweziga omuyaga gwabituntumura, waashusha oti haaba hataine kiriho. Kwonka eryo ibaare, eryateera ekyo kishushani, ryahinduka orushozi ruhango, rwamara ensi yoona.<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />Ekyo nikyo kirooto; mbwenu twaza kushobororera omugabe amakuru gaakyo. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:2">Ezr 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:12">7:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:7">Ezk 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:18">Dan 5:18</ref>. </char></note> Nyakusinga, omugabe w'abagabe, ou Ruhanga w'omu iguru yaahaire obugabe, obushoboorozi, amaani n'ekitiinisa, <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:6">Yer 27:6</ref>. </char></note> kandi akakuha abaana b'abantu, enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa n'amahungu g'omu mwanya, akakugira omutegyeki waabyo byona, ahu bituura hoona, mbwenu niiwe ogwo mutwe gw'ezaabu. <verse eid="DAN 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:28">Dan 5:28</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:31">31</ref>. </char></note> Ku orirugaho, haryaimuka obundi bugabe oburikukirwa obwawe; bwanyima hakurateho obundi bugabe bwa kashatu obw'omuringa, butegyekye ensi yoona. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:40, 41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi haryabaho obugabe bwa kana, obugumire nk'ekyoma, ahabw'okuba ekyoma kyatagura ebintu byona, kibicwa obusaasingo; nk'oku ekyoma kyatagura, nikwo n'obwo bugabe buryatagura obwo bwona, bukabucwa obusaasingo. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Kandi nk'oku oreebire ebigyere n'enkumu zaabyo biri eibumba ry'omubumbi n'ekyoma, nikwo obwo bugabe buryebaganisamu; kwonka omuribwo haryabamu okuguma kw'ekyoma, nk'oku oreebire ekyoma kijwangizemu eibumba. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Kandi nk'oku enkumu z'ebigyere zibaire ziri ekyoma kandi eibumba, nikwo n'obwo bugabe buriba; ekicweka kyabwo kiryaba ekigumire, n'ekindi kibe ekirikwetwa busha. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Kandi nk'oku oreebire ekyoma kijwangire n'eibumba, nikwo barishwerana, bakajwanga, kwonka tibariguma hamwe, nk'oku ekyoma kitajwanga na ibumba. <verse eid="DAN 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:3">Dan 4:3</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:26">6:26</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">7:14</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:7">Mik 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:33">Luk 1:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:36">Yoh 18:36</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:24">1 Kor 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:15">Kush 11:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu busingye bw'abo bagabe Ruhanga w'omu iguru aryataho obundi bugabe, obutaricwekyerezibwa ebiro byona, kandi obutegyeki bwabwo tiburihungurwa rindi ihanga; kureka buryayatagura obwo bugabe bwona, bubumareho, kandi bwo buryagumaho, <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />nk'oku oreebire eibaare ryatimbira omu rushozi, ritahigwirwe muntu, rikaacwanyagura ekyoma, emiringa, eibumba, efeeza n'ezaabu. Ruhanga omukuru ashuuruuriire omugabe ebiribaho bwanyima. Ekyo kirooto n'eky'amazima, n'amakuru gaakyo tigarikubanganisibwa.<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 10:25">Byak 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:13">14:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho omugabe Nebukadeneeza yaajuumara omu maisho ga Danieli, yaamuramya, yaaragiira ku bamutambira ebitambo, bakamwoterera obubaane. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Bir 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 14:25">1 Kor 14:25</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:15">1 Tim 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:14">Kush 17:14</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira Danieli ati: Buzimazima Ruhanga waanyu niwe Ruhanga Nyamuhanga, Mukama w'abagabe, kandi niwe ashuuruura ebitarikumanywa; ahabw'okuba obaasize kushuuruura eki ekitarikumanywa. <verse eid="DAN 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:6">Dan 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:9">4:9</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:11">5:11</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe yaaha Danieli ekitiinisa kingi n'ebiconco bingi bihango, yaamugira omutegyeki w'eishaza omureeberezi mukuru w'abanyabwengye b'omuri Babulooni boona. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Kandi Danieli yaashaba omugabe, omugabe yaataho Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego kureeberera eishaza rya Babulooni; kwonka Danieli we yaaguma omu kikaari ky'omugabe.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ekishushani kya Nebukadeneeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Omugabe Nebukadeneeza akakora ekishushani ky'ezaabu, oburaingwa bwakyo mikono makumi mukaaga, n'obuhango bwakyo mikono mukaaga. Yaakyemereza omu ruhita rwa Duura omu ishaza rya Babulooni. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Bwanyima omugabe Nebukadeneeza yaatuma kuteeranira hamwe ab'amashaza, abareeberezi, abakuru b'amahe, abahi b'obwengye, ababiiki, abahi b'ebiragiro, abaramuzi, n'abakungu boona ab'omu mashaza ngu baije kushoroora ekishushani eki omugabe Nebukadeneeza yaayemereize. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Batyo ab'amashaza, abareeberezi, abakuru b'amahe, abahi b'obwengye, ababiiki, abahi b'ebiragiro, abaramuzi n'abakungu boona ab'omu mashaza, baija, baateeranira hamwe kushoroora ekishushani eki omugabe Nebukadeneeza yaayemereize. <verse eid="DAN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Omurangi yaaranga n'eiraka rihango, naagira ati: Imwe abantu b'amahanga, n'enganda, n'ab'endimi ezitari zimwe, nimuragiirwa ngu, <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />ku muraahurire amaraka g'enzamba, esheegu, endingiri, amakondere, enanga, obunyamurera n'emiringo yoona ey'ebirikugamba, mujuumare ahansi, muramye ekishushani ky'ezaabu eki omugabe Nebukadeneeza ayemereize; <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:22">Yer 29:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:15">Kush 13:15</ref>. </char></note> kandi omuntu weena oraayangye kujuumara ahansi kukiramya, naija kunagwa ahonaaho omu kikoomi ky'omuriro ogurikubuguma. <verse eid="DAN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo abantu boona ku bahuriire amaraka g'enzamba, esheegu, endingiri, amakondere, enanga, obunyamurera n'emiringo yoona ey'ebirikugamba, abantu boona ab'amahanga, n'enganda n'ab'endimi ezitari zimwe, baajuumara ahansi, baaramya ekyo kishushani ky'ezaabu, eki omugabe Nebukadeneeza yaayemereize.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Omuri ako kaanya Abakaludaaya bamwe baija, baarega Abayudaaya, <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:4">Dan 2:4</ref>. </char></note> nibagira omugabe Nebukadeneeza bati: Karamaare, Nyakusinga! <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />Nyakusinga omugabe, otaireho ekiragiro, ngu omuntu weena oraahurire amaraka g'enzamba, esheegu, endigiri, amakondere, enanga, obunyamurera, n'emiringo yoona ey'ebirikugamba ajuumare ahansi, aramye ekishushani ky'ezaabu; <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />kandi ngu oraayangye kujuumara ahansi kukiramya, anagwe omu kikoomi ky'omuriro ogurikubuguma. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:7">Dan 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:13">6:13</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hariho Abayudaaya bamwe, abu waataireho kureeberera eishaza rya Babulooni, Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego. Nyakusinga, abo bashaija tibarikukwetaho; tibarikuheereza baaruhanga baawe, kandi bangire kuramya ekishushani ky'ezaabu, eki oyemereize.<verse eid="DAN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba Seduraaka okwangira kimwe kuramya ekishushani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Ahonaaho Nebukadeneeza yaagira ekiniga kingi, yaaragiira ku bareeta Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego. Batyo baabareeta omu maisho g'omugabe. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Nebukadeneeza yaababuuza ati: Iwe Seduraaka, na Mesaaki na Abedeneego, n'eky'amazima, mwangire kuheereza baaruhanga bangye n'okuramya ekishushani ky'ezaabu, eki nyemereize? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:20">Dan 6:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 5:2">Kur 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:35">2 Bag 18:35</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ku muraahurire amaraka g'enzamba, esheegu, endingiri, amakondere, enanga, obunyamurera, n'emiringo yoona ey'ebirikugamba, mwaikiriza kujuumara ahansi kuramya ekishushani eki nyemereize, obwo biri byaba gye; kwonka ku muraayangye kuramya, ahonaaho nimwija kunagwa omu kikoomi ky'omuriro ogurikubuguma. Mbwenu ni ruhanga ki oraabaihe omu mikono yangye?<verse eid="DAN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego baagarukamu omugabe bati: Nyakusinga Nebukadeneeza, tihaine kirikutugyema kukugarukamu aha kigambo ekyo. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Ku kiraabe kityo, Ruhanga waitu, ou tuheereza, naabaasa kutwiha omu kikoomi ky'omuriro ogurikubuguma; kandi naija kutwiha omu mikono yaawe, Nyakusinga Omugabe. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:29">Byak 5:29</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'obu kiraabe kitabaaire kityo, Nyakusinga, okimanyire kimwe ku tutarikwija kuheereza baaruhanga baawe, n'obu kwakuba okuramya ekishushani ky'ezaabu eki oyemereize.<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba Seduraaka okunagwa omu kikoomi ky'omuriro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Okuruga aho Nebukadeneeza yaagira ekiniga kingi, aha maisho ge haahinduriza, yaateera Seduraaka, Mesaaki, na Abedeneego ekitsyori; yaaragiira okukoomeera omuriro ngu gubone kwaka n'amaani okukira oku gutakabaga emirundi mushanju. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />Bwanyima yaatoorana abashaija b'amaani omu ngabo ze, yaabaragiira kuboha Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego, n'okubanaga omu kikoomi ky'omuriro ogurikubuguma. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Batyo baaboha abo bashaija bajwaire empare ndaingwa n'ekooti n'enkofiira n'ebindi bijwaro, ebi baabaire bajwaire, baabanaga omu kikoomi ky'omuriro ogurikubuguma. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Kandi ahabw'ekiragiro ky'omugabe kuba eky'amaani, n'omuriro kubugumira kimwe, endimi z'omuriro zaita abo bashaija, abaakiriize Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:12">1 Pet 4:12</ref>. </char></note> Batyo abo bashaija bonshatu, Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego baagwa omu kikoomi ky'omuriro ogurikubuguma babohirwe.<verse eid="DAN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Bwanyima omugabe Nebukadeneeza yaatangaara, yaimuka n'obwira, yaabuuza abahi b'obwengye be ati: Hari abashaija abu twanaga omu muriro babohirwe baaba batari bashatu? Baamugarukamu bati: Nikwo, Nyakusinga. <verse eid="DAN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:23">Dan 6:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 1:6">Yob 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:2">Isa 43:2</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Mbwenu nindeeba abashaija bana batabohirwe, nibagyendagyenda ahagati omu muriro, bataine ku babaire; kandi emishusire y'owa kana neeshusha ey'omwana wa baaruhanga.<verse eid="DAN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 4:2">Dan 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:18">5:18</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:21">21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nebukadeneeza yairira aha muryango gw'ekikoomi ky'omuriro ogurikubuguma, yaagira ati: Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego, imwe abairu ba Ruhanga orikukira boona, nimushohore, mwije aha. Batyo Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego baaruga omu muriro. <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:34">Heb 11:34</ref>. </char></note> Ab'amashaza, abakuru b'amahe, n'abahi b'obwengye b'omugabe baateeranira hamwe, baareeba abo bashaija, baashanga omuriro gutaine ki gubaitsize, eishokye ry'aha mitwe yaabo ritababukire, ebijwaro byabo bitaine ku bibaire, n'ekibabo ky'omuriro kitarikubanuukaho.<verse eid="DAN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugabe okuhimbisa Ruhanga wa ba Seduraaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 6:22">Dan 6:22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:3">Kur 20:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:2">Zab 25:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:7">34:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Nebukadeneeza yaagira ati: Ruhanga wa Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego asiimwe; niwe yaayohereza maraika we, akajuna abairu be abaamwesiga, bakahindura busha ekiragiro ky'omugabe, bakooga amagara gaabo okukira okuheereza ruhanga ondiijo otari Ruhanga waabo buzima. <verse eid="DAN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:5">Dan 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ndikuteeraho ekiragiro ngu, abantu boona b'omu mahanga goona n'enganda zoona ez'endimi ezitari zimwe, abarirogota ahari Ruhanga wa Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego, batemagurwe, n'amaka gaabo gasheenywe; ahabw'okuba tihariho ruhanga ondiijo orikubaasa kujuna ebi bigyene. <verse eid="DAN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Okuruga aho omugabe yaakuza Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego omu ishaza rya Babulooni.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ekirooto kya Nebukadeneeza eky'omuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 6:25">Dan 6:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:2">1 Pet 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 1:2">2 Pet 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe amahanga goona, n'enganda zoona ez'endimi ezitari zimwe, abatwire omu nsi yoona, nyowe, omugabe Nebukadeneeza, naabahandiikira. Obusingye bukanye omuriimwe! <verse eid="DAN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:26">Dan 3:26</ref>. </char></note> Kyanshemeza kworeka obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza ebi Ruhanga orikukira boona ankoreire.<verse eid="DAN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2:44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obumanyiso bwe ka ni bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:3">N'eby'okutangaaza bye ka ni bikuru!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:3">Obukama bwe n'obukama obutarihwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:3">N'obutegyeki bwe bugumaho, nk'oku obusingye bugyenda nibwihaihana.<verse eid="DAN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />Nyowe, Nebukadeneeza, nkaba ngaramisiriize omu nju yangye, eby'omu kikaari kyangye byona nibigyenda gye. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />Ekiro kimwe naaroota ekirooto ekyantiiniise; ku naabaire mbyami aha kitanda kyangye, ebiteekateeko n'ebi naayorekirwe omu mutwe gwangye byandeetera kwemereza omutima. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Nikyo naaragiriire ku bandeetera abanyabwengye b'omuri Babulooni boona, ngu banshobororere ebi naarootsire, <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:27">Dan 2:27</ref>. </char></note> Batyo abafumu n'abahi b'engisha n'Abakaludaaya, n'abarikuragura eby'enyonyoozi, baija, naabagambira ekyo kirooto, kwonka baaremwa kukinshobororera. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:11">Dan 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:38">Kut 41:38</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Danieli yaija omu maisho gangye, (Danieli ogwo niwe owaayetsirwe Beliteeshaza, nibamweterera ruhanga wangye, kandi owaabaire aine omwoyo gwa baaruhanga abarikwera) naamugambira ekyo kirooto, ningira nti: <verse eid="DAN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:48">Dan 2:48</ref>. </char></note> Iwe Beliteeshaza, omukuru w'abafumu, nimmanya ngu oine omwoyo gwa baaruhanga abarikwera, kandi tihaine kitarikumanywa eki oremwa kushoboorora; mbwenu nshobororera ekirooto eki ndootsire, mmanye amakuru gaakyo. <verse eid="DAN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:3">Ezk 31:3</ref>. </char></note> Ebi nyorekirwe ndi aha kitanda kyangye nibyo ebi. Ku ngiire kugira nti, naareeba ekiti kirumbaire ahagati y'ensi, oburaingwa bwakyo burengyesereize. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Ekyo kiti kyakura, kyahama, omutwe gwakyo gwahika omu iguru, kyareebwa ab'aha muheru gw'ensi yoona; <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:6">Ezk 31:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 31:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:32">Mak 4:32</ref>. </char></note> amababi gaakyo gaabengyeya, n'ebijuma byakyo byaba bingi; kandi kyabamu eby'okurya ebirikuhaazya abantu boona; enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa zaabona ekicuucu ahansi yaakyo, amahungu g'omu mwanya gaatuura omu mataagi gaakyo, n'ebiine omubiri byona kyaba nikyo kyabitunga.<verse eid="DAN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:2">Bir 33:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebindi ebi ndeebire ndi aha kitanda kyangye nibyo ebi; ndeebire orikwera owaagizirwe omurinzi naashuuma naaruga omu iguru. <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mat 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Yaaragiira n'eiraka rihango naagira ati: Tema ekyo kiti, okikonkoboreho amataagi, okiiheho amababi, onaganagye ebijuma byakyo, enyamaishwa zihungye ahansi yaakyo, n'amahungu garugye omu mataagi gaakyo; <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />kwonka ekitsintsi okirekye kiri aha mizi yaakyo omu itaka omu bunyaatsi bw'omuroba obw'omu ishwa kibohirwe ebyoma n'emiringa, kigume nikitondwaho orume orurikuruga omu iguru, kandi kirye n'enyamaishwa obunyaatsi bw'omu ishwa; <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />omutima gwakyo gurekye kuguma guri ogw'omuntu, kureka kiheebwe omutima gw'enyamaishwa; kigume kityo okumara omwanya nk'ogw'emyaka mushanju. <verse eid="DAN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:21">Dan 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:8">1 Sam 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:5">Yer 27:5</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kifubiro kiragiirwe abarinzi, kyateebwaho ekigambo ky'abarikwera, ngu abakiriho abahuriire bamanye ngu Orikukira boona niwe ategyeka obugabe bw'abantu, kandi akabugabira ou arikwenda, akabwemekamu ab'ahansi okukira abandi boona. <verse eid="DAN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:8">Dan 5:8</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:8">Kut 41:8</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kirooto, nyowe omugabe Nebukadeneeza, niinye nkirootsire. Mbwenu iwe Beliteeshaza, okinshobororere, ahabw'okuba abanyabwengye boona tibarikubaasa kukinshobororera; kwonka iwe nookibaasa, ahabw'okuba omwoyo gwa baaruhanga abarikwera guri omuriiwe.<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Danieli okushororera omugabe ekirooto kye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 18:32">2 Sam 18:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Danieli owaayetsirwe Beliteeshaza yaamara omwanya muhango ashobeirwe, ayemereize omutima ahabw'ebiteekateeko bye. Omugabe yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Iwe Beliteeshaza, ekyo kirooto n'amakuru gaakyo birekye kukwemereza omutima. Beliteeshaza yaamugarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, ekyo kirooto nikikabe aha barikukwanga, n'amakuru gaakyo nigakabe aha bazigu baawe! <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Mbwenu ekyo kiti ki oreebire nikikura, kikahama, omutwe gwakyo gukahika omu iguru, kikareebwa ab'aha muheru gw'ensi yoona, <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:32">Mak 4:32</ref>. </char></note> n'amababi gaakyo gakabengyeya, kikagira ebijuma bingi, kikabamu eby'okurya ebirikuhaazya abantu boona, kandi enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa zikabona ekicuucu ahansi yaakyo, amahungu g'omu mwanya gakatuura omu mataagi gaakyo, <verse eid="DAN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:6-8">Yer 27:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:3">Ezk 31:3</ref>. </char></note> Nyakusinga, ekyo kiti niiwe. Okakura, waahama, obukuru bwawe bwayeyongyera bwahika omu iguru, n'obutegyeki bwawe bwahika aha muheru gw'ensi. <verse eid="DAN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Kandi, nk'oku omugabe areebire orikwera ogizirwe omurinzi naashuuma naaruga omu iguru, akagira ati: Tema ekyo kiti, okimareho; kwonka ekitsintsi n'emizi yaakyo obibohese ebyoma n'emiringa, obirekye omu itaka omu bunyaatsi bw'omuroba obw'omu ishwa, kigume nikitondwaho orume orurikuruga omu iguru, kandi kirye n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa, kigume kityo okumara omwanya nk'ogw'emyaka mushanju; <verse eid="DAN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />mbwenu Nyakusinga, amakuru gaakyo nigo aga. Omanye ku kiri ekiragiro kya Rukira-boona, ekyahika ahari mukama wangye omugabe. <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:21">Dan 5:21</ref>. </char></note> Noija kubingwa omu bantu, otaahe n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa, orye obunyaatsi nk'ente, otondweho orume orurikuruga omu iguru, omare omwanya nk'ogw'emyaka mushanju ori otyo, okuhitsya obu orimanya ngu Rukira-boona niwe ategyeka obugabe bw'abantu, akabuha ou arikwenda weena. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Kandi nk'oku baragiire kureka ekitsintsi n'emizi y'ekyo kiti, nikwo obugabe bwawe burikwija kukurindirwa, okuhitsya obu orimanya ngu Eiguru niryo ritegyeka. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:6">Enf 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:8">Yer 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:10">Yon 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:22">Byak 8:22</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:25">2 Tim 2:25</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo, Nyakusinga, ninkushaba oikirize obwengye obu ndikukuha; omareho ebibi byawe ahabw'okukora eby'okuhikiirira, kandi ebicumuro byawe obiihiseho okugirira abarikuhatwa embabazi, obundi okuba gye kwawe kukaabaasa kwongyerwaho.<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekirooto okuhikiirira aha mugabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />Bwanyima ebyo byona byahika aha mugabe. Nebukadeneeza. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />Ku haahingwire ameezi ikumi n'abiri, eizooba rimwe omugabe akaba naagyendagyenda aha mutwe gw'enju, nyaruju y'obugabe bwa Babulooni. <verse eid="DAN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:20">Dan 5:20</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira ati: Babulooni egi yoona t'ei naayombekire n'amaani g'obushoboorozi bwangye kandi n'ekitiinisa ky'obukuru bwangye? <verse eid="DAN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:20">Luk 12:20</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo bigambo ku byabaire bitakarugire mu kanwa k'omugabe, eiraka ryaruga omu iguru nirigira riti: Iwe mugabe 'we Nebukadeneeza, niiwe orikugambirwa. Obugabe bwawe bwakwihwaho, <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32, 33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:21">Dan 5:21</ref>. </char></note> noija kubingwa omu bantu, otuure n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa; noija kurya obunyaatsi nk'ente; kandi omare omwanya nk'ogw'emyaka mushanju ori otyo, okuhitsya obu orimanya ku Rukira-boona niwe ategyeka obugabe bw'abantu, akabuha ou arikwenda weena. <verse eid="DAN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Ahonaaho ekigambo ekyo kyahikiirira ahari Nebukadeneeza, yaabingwa omu bantu, yaaguma naarya obunyaatsi nk'ente, omubiri gwe nigutondwaho orume orurikuruga omu iguru, okuhitsya obu eishokye rye ryakuzire rikaba nk'amooya g'eishamba, n'ebyara bye bikashokoza nk'eby'enyonyi.<verse eid="DAN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2:44</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:26">6:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:16">Zab 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:10">Kush 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:15">11:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo biro, nyowe Nebukadeneeza nkaimutsya amaisho gangye ahaiguru, naagarukwamu akengye, naasiima Rukira-boona, naahimbisa Otahwaho ebiro byona, naamuha ekitiinisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:34">Ahabw'okuba obutegyeki bwe n'obutegyeki obutahwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:34">Kandi obukama bwe bugumaho, nk'oku obusingye bugyenda nibwihaihana.<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:12">Yob 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:3">Zab 115:3</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:4">Mub 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:27">Isa 14:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:17">40:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:20">Rom 9:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abatuura omu nsi boona nibabarwa nka busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">Akora omu mahe g'omu iguru n'omu batuura omu nsi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">Nk'oku arikwenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">Kandi tihariho obaasa kumuteera ha mukono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">Nari okugira ati: Eki nookora ki?<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />Omu bunaku nibwo bumwe naagarukwamu akengye, kandi obukuru bwangye n'okwizihirwa kwangye byangarukaho kureetera obugabe bwangye ekitiinisa. Abahi b'obwengye bangye n'abakungu bangye bankubuukira, naahamibwa omu bugabe bwangye, n'obukuru bwangye bwayongyerwaho.<verse eid="DAN 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 5:20">Dan 5:20</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:4">Bir 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:4">Zab 33:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 29:23">Enf 29:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:3">Kush 15:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nyowe Nebukadeneeza ninsiima Omukama w'eiguru, nimmusingiza, kandi nimmuha ekitiinisa; ahakuba emirimo ye ehikire, emihanda ye n'ey'amazima, kandi abo abatuura n'amaryo naabaasa kubagarura ahansi.<verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Engaro okuhandiika aha kisiika omu bugyenyi bwa Belishaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Omugabe Belishaza akateekyera abakungu be rukumi obugyenyi bwingi munonga, yaanywera viinyo omu maisho g'abo bakungu rukumi. <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2, 3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:2">Dan 1:2</ref>. </char></note> Belishaza, ku yaashomire ati ahari viinyo, yaaragiira kumureetera ebintu by'ezaabu n'efeeza, ebi Nebukadeneeza ishe yaanyagire omuri hekalu ya Yerusaalemu, ngu we n'abakungu be, abakazi be n'ebinyanshunju bye babinywaise. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />Batyo baamureetera ebyo bintu by'ezaabu n'efeeza, ebyaihirwe omuri hekalu, enju ya Ruhanga, omuri Yerusaalemu; omugabe, abakungu be, abakazi be n'ebinyanshunju bye baabinywaisa; <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4-7">Zab 115:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:15-17">135:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:20">Kush 9:20</ref>. </char></note> baanywa viinyo, baahimbisa baaruhanga baabo b'ezaabu, b'efeeza, b'emiringa, b'ebyoma, b'ebiti, kandi n'ab'amabaare.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Ahonaaho enkumu z'engaro y'omuntu zaareebeka, zaahandiika aha kisiika kya nyaruju y'omugabe aharikureebana n'ekikondo ky'etabaaza; omugabe yaareeba egyo ngaro neehandiika. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 2:10">Nah 2:10</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaagireebire, yaahinduriza ahamaisho, yaayemereza omutima ahabw'ebiteekateeko; amanyaanya gaamunyuukuka, eseiso z'amaju zaakomangana. <verse eid="DAN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:6">Dan 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:42">Kut 41:42</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaataka n'eiraka rihango, naagira ati: Nimundeetere abafumu n'Abakaludaaya n'abarikuragura eby'enyonyoozi. Abo banyabwengye b'omuri Babulooni ku baizire, omugabe yaabagira ati: Weena oraashome ekyo kihandiiko, akakinshobororera, naija kujwekwa omwenda gwa bujwa, n'omukuufu gw'ezaabu omu bitsya, kandi abe omutegyeki wa kashatu omu bugabe. <verse eid="DAN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:7">Dan 4:7</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:8">Kut 41:8</ref>. </char></note> Batyo abo banyabwengye b'omugabe baatahamu, kwonka baaremwa kushoma ekyo kihandiiko, n'obu kwakuba okukimushobororera. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Omugabe Belishaza yaayemereza munonga omutima, yaahinduriza ahamaisho, n'abakungu be baashoberwa.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:4">Dan 2:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyin'omugabe, ahabw'okuhurira ebigambo by'omugabe n'abakungu be, yaataaha omu nju y'obugyenyi, yaagira ati: Karamaare, Nyakusinga! Reka kwemereza omutima ahabw'ebi orikuteekateeka, n'obu kwakuba okuhinduriza ahamaisho. <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:48">Dan 2:48</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:8">4:8</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, omu bugabe bwawe harimu omushaija oine omwoyo gwa baaruhanga abarikwera. Nangwa n'omu busingye bwa sho, okuhweza okwetegyereza n'obwengye nk'obwa baaruhanga bikaba bimureebekamu, kandi sho, omugabe Nebukadeneeza, akamugira omukuru w'abafumu, abahi b'obwengye, Abakaludaaya n'abarikuragura eby'enyonyoozi; <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:7">Dan 1:7</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba ogwo mushaija Danieli, ou omugabe yaayetsire Beliteeshaza, akareebwamu omwoyo murungi n'okwetegyereza, akaba abaasa kurootorora ebirooto, n'okwita ebishaakuzo, n'okushoboorora ebiremire. Mbwenu nibamukwetere, naija kushoboorora n'eki.<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Danieli okushoma ekihandiiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Bwanyima baareeta Danieli omu maisho g'omugabe. Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Niiwe Danieli ow'omu Bayuda abaanyagirwe, ou tata omugabe yaihire omuri Yuda? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:20">Dan 1:20</ref>. </char></note> Mpuriire nibakugambaho ku oine omwoyo gwa baaruhanga abarikwera, kandi ngu okwaka, okwetegyereza n'obwengye ebirikukira eby'abandi nibikureebekamu. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />Baanyetera abanyabwengye n'abafumu kushoma eki kihandiiko, n'okunshobororera amakuru gaakyo, kwonka tibaakibaasa. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />Mbwenu mpuriire ngu iwe noobaasa kumanyisa amakuru g'ebintu n'okushoboorora ebiremire. Hati ku oraabe noobaasa kushoma eki kihandiiko, n'okunshobororera amakuru gaakyo, noija kujwekwa omwenda gwa bujwa, n'omukuufu gw'ezaabu omu bitsya, kandi obe omutegyeki wa kashatu omu bugabe.<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 5:16">2 Bag 5:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Danieli yaagarukiramu omu maisho g'omugabe ati: Ebiconco byawe guma nabyo, n'ebihembo byawe obihe abandi; kwonka nyowe naaza kushomera omugabe eki kihandiiko, kandi mmushobororere n'amakuru gaakyo. <verse eid="DAN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:37">Dan 2:37</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 3:26">3:26</ref>. </char></note> Nyakusinga, Ruhanga orikukira boona akaha sho Nebukadeneeza obugabe, okurangaanwa, ekitiinisa n'obukuru; <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />abantu b'amahanga goona, n'enganda z'endimi ezitari zimwe, bakaba bamutiina, batetema omu maisho ge ahabw'obukuru obu Ruhanga yaamuhaire. Akaba aita ou arikwenda kwita, akiza ou arikwenda kukiza, atunguura ou arikwenda kutunguura, agarura ahansi ou arikwenda kugaruraho. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:30">Dan 4:30</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:10">Ezk 31:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 31:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:23">Byak 12:23</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku yaayetungwire, yaagangaaza omutima gwe, yaakora eby'amaryo, yaihwa aha kitebe ky'obugabe, n'ekitiinisa kye kyamwihwaho. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:25">Dan 4:25</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:32">32</ref>. </char></note> Yaabingwa omu bantu, omutima gwe gwahinduka nk'ogw'enyamaishwa, yaatuura n'enturegye, yaarya obunyaatsi nk'ente, n'omubiri gwe gwaguma nigutondwaho orume orurikuruga omu iguru, okuhitsya obu yaamanyire ngu Ruhanga orikukira boona niwe ategyeka obugabe bw'abantu, kandi akabwemekamu ou arikwenda. <verse eid="DAN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />Kandi naiwe omutabani Belishaza tocureize mutima gwawe, n'obu oraabe omanyire ebyo byona, <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:10">Yob 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:15-17">Zab 135:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:23">Yer 10:23</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:2">Dan 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:37">4:37</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:23">Byak 12:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:20">Kush 9:20</ref>. </char></note> kureka oyetungwire, waagomera Mukama w'eiguru, baakureetera ebintu by'omu nju ye, iwe, abakungu baawe, abakazi baawe, n'ebinyanshunju byawe, mwabinywaisa viinyo, mwahimbisa baaruhanga b'efeeza, b'ezaabu, b'emiringa, b'ebyoma, b'ebiti, n'ab'amabaare abatarikureeba, abatarikuhurira, n'obu kwakuba okumanya; haza Ruhanga, ou omwitsyo gwawe guba omu mukono gwe, kandi orikutegyeka orugyendo rw'amagara gaawe rwona, tiwaamuha kitiinisa.<verse eid="DAN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Nikyo ayoherereize egyo ngaro, ekahandiika eki kihandiiko; <verse eid="DAN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />kandi ebihandiikirwe nibyo ebi-MENE, MENE, TEKEELI, PARASIINI. <verse eid="DAN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />Kandi oku nikwo birikushoboororwa. MENE, Ruhanga abazire ebiro by'obugabe bwawe, yaabugarukiza aho; <verse eid="DAN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:6">Yob 31:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:9">Zab 62:9</ref>. </char></note> TEKEELI, opimirwe aha minzaani, waashangwa otahikire; <verse eid="DAN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:17">Isa 13:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:11">Yer 51:11</ref>. </char></note> PERESI, obugabe bwawe bubaganisiibwemu, bwaheebwa Abameedi n'Abaperesi.<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 5:7">Dan 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:15">Est 8:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho Belishaza yaaragiira ku bajweka Danieli omwenda gwa bujwa n'omukuufu gw'ezaabu omu bitsya, kandi baamuranga ku arikwija kuba omutegyeki wa kashatu omu bugabe. <verse eid="DAN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:24">Yer 50:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:31">51:31</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ekyo kiro Belishaza omugabe w'Abakaludaaya yaitwa. <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:1">Dan 9:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Dario Omumeedi yaaheebwa obugabe, aine emyaka makumi mukaaga n'ebiri.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Danieli okunagwa omu kiina ky'entare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Dario akasiima kucwa obugabe bwe omu bicweka igana na makumi abiri, n'okubitamu ab'amashaza, ngu babone kubuga obugabe bwe bwona; <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />kandi yaataho abakuru bashatu b'okubareeberera; omwe aharibo akaba ari Danieli; abo nibo ab'amashaza baabaire bahikizaho eby'omugabe, ngu arekye kufeerwa. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:12">Dan 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:40">Kut 41:40</ref>; <ref loc="EST 10:3">Est 10:3</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Danieli ogwo yaayoga ahari abo bakuru bagyenzi be n'abamashaza boona, ahabw'okuba akaba aine omwoyo murungi; nangwa n'omugabe akaba naayenda kumukwatsa obugabe bwona. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:14">Ezk 14:14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 14:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:15">Fil 2:15</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo abakuru n'abamashaza baasherura eki baraiheho kukwatsa Danieli orubanja omu bigambo by'obugabe; kwonka baabura ahu baraihe kumukwatsa orubanja, nari okumureebaho ekicumuro kyona, ahabw'okuba akaba ari omwesigwa, atarikureebwamu kishobyo, n'obu kyakuba ekicumuro. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Abo bashaija baagira bati: Titwine ki turaiheho kukwatsa Danieli orubanja, kureka tumuturukye omu biragiro bya Ruhanga we.<verse eid="DAN 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Bwanyima abo bakuru n'abamashaza baija aha mugabe n'omutima gumwe, baamugira bati: Karamaare, Nyakusinga Omugabe Dario! <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Abakuru b'omu bugabe bwona, abareeberezi, abamashaza, abahi b'obwengye n'abategyeki baikirizana ngu omugabe ateho ekiragiro kihamire, ekirikugira kiti: Omu biro makumi ashatu omuntu oraashabe ruhanga weena, nari omuntu weena otariiwe, anagwe omu kiina ky'entare. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:19">Est 1:19</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:8">8:8</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, Nyakusinga, hamya ekyo kiragiro, okiteho omukono, kirekye kuhindurwa, nk'oku ebiragiro by'Abameedi n'Abaperesi bitahindurwa. <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Atyo omugabe Dario yaata omukono aha kihandiiko ky'ekyo kiragiro.<verse eid="DAN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:48">1 Bag 8:48</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:2">Zab 28:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 55:17">55:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 138:2">138:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Danieli, ku yaamanyire ngu ekiragiro kyateebwaho omukono, yaataaha omu nju ye; (kandi amadirisa g'omu kishengye kye ky'ahaiguru gakaba gaigwire nigareeba Yerusaalemu) yaaguma naatsimba amaju kashatu buri izooba omu maisho ga Ruhanga we, naashaba kandi naasiima, nk'oku yaabaire atwaza. <verse eid="DAN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Eizooba rimwe abo bashaija baija n'omutima gumwe, baashanga Danieli naashaba kandi naayeshengyereza omu maisho ga Ruhanga we. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Bwanyima baaza omu maisho g'omugabe, baagamba aha by'ekiragiro kye, nibabagira bati: Nyakusinga, hari totaire omukono aha kiragiro ekirikugira kiti: Omu biro makumi ashatu omuntu oraashabe ruhanga weena nari omuntu weena otariiwe, anagwe omu kiina ky'entare? Omugabe yaagarukamu ati: Ekyo kiragiro nikwo kiri, n'ekiragiro kihamire, nk'oku ebiragiro by'Abameedi n'Abaperesi bitahindurwa. <verse eid="DAN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Baamugarukamu bati: Eryo ihano Danieli ow'omu Bayuda abaanyagirwe tarikukwetaho, Nyakusinga n'obu kwakuba okweta aha kiragiro eki otaireho omukono; kureka naashaba kashatu buri izooba.<verse eid="DAN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:26">Mak 6:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe ku yaahuriire ebigambo ebyo, yaashaasha munonga, yaata omutima ahari Danieli kumujuna; yaarabanamu okurenzya eizooba naasherura oburyo bw'okumukiza. <verse eid="DAN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Abo bashaija baagaruka baateeranira ow'omugabe, baamugira bati: Nyakusinga, noomanya ku guba omucwe gw'Abameedi n'Abaperesi, ku ekiragiro nari ekitairweho eki omugabe ahamya kitabaasa kuhindurwa. <verse eid="DAN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:23">Byak 27:23</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 1:10">2 Kor 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe yaaragiira, baareeta Danieli, baamunaga omu kiina ky'entare. Omugabe yaagira Danieli ati: Nangwa bambe Ruhanga waawe, ou oheereza obutoosha, takujuna! <verse eid="DAN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:12">Est 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:53">Tonz 3:53</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:66">Mat 27:66</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:3">Kush 20:3</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baareeta eibaare, baarita aha munwa gw'ekiina, omugabe yaarihamisa akamanyiso ke n'akamanyiso k'abakungu be, ngu omu bigambo bya Danieli hatagira ekyahindurwaho na kimwe. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:1">Est 6:1</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho omugabe yaagaruka omu kikaari kye, yaayeraazakwo, tibaamuteerera nanga, n'oturo twamuguruka.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Ku bwabaire nibutaagurikana, omugabe yaimuka, yaagyenda naayehuuta, yaaza aha kiina ky'entare. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:15">Dan 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:17">2 Tim 4:17</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaahikire ahari ekyo kiina ki Danieli yaabaire arimu, yaayeta n'eiraka ry'obusaasi naagira ati: Iwe Danieli, omuheereza wa Ruhanga ohuriire, Ruhanga waawe ou oheereza obutoosha, abaasize kukujuna entare? <verse eid="DAN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Danieli yaagarukamu omugabe ati: Karamaare, Nyakusinga! <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:28">Dan 3:28</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:4">6:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:21">Zab 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:14">Heb 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:33">11:33</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:17">2 Tim 4:17</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga wangye atumire maraika we, yaigara eminwa y'entare, tiziine ku zingizire, ahabw'okuba mbaire ntaine kamogo omu maisho ge, kandi ntaine ki ncumwire omu maisho gaawe, Nyakusinga. <verse eid="DAN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:25">Dan 3:25</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaashemererwa munonga, yaaragiira ku baiha Danieli omu kiina. Batyo baamwihamu, baashanga ataine ku abaire kwona, ahabw'okuba akeesiga Ruhanga we. <verse eid="DAN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:19">Bir 19:19</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe yaaragiira, baareeta abo bashaija abaregire Danieli, hamwe n'abaana baabo n'abakazi baabo, baabanaga omuri ekyo kiina ky'entare; entare zaabashamira omu mwanya, zaahendagura amagufa gaabo goona batakahikire hansi omu kiina.<verse eid="DAN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 4:1">Dan 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe Dario yaahandiikira abantu b'amahanga goona n'ab'enganda z'endimi ezitari zimwe, abatwire omu nsi yoona, naagira ati: Obusingye bukanye omuriimwe! <verse eid="DAN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:34">Dan 4:34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:1">Zab 99:1</ref>. </char></note> Naataho ekiragiro nti: Abantu b'omu bugabe bwangye bwona bagume bateteme omu maisho ga Ruhanga wa Danieli, bamutiine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">Ahakuba niwe Ruhanga ohuriire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">Ogumaho ebiro byona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">Obugabe bwe tiburihwerekyerezibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">N'obutegyeki bwe buryahika aha mperu.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 3:28">Dan 3:28</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 3:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe ajuna, kandi akakiza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:27">Niwe akora obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza omu iguru n'omu nsi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:27">Kandi niwe ajunire Danieli, akamwiha omu byara by'entare.<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 1:21">Dan 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:1">10:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:22">2 Bus 36:22</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Danieli yaaguma ari gye omu busingye bwa Dario n'omu bwa Kuuro Omuperesi.<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Danieli okuroota enyamaishwa ina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />Omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwa Belishaza omugabe wa Babulooni, Danieli akaroota ekirooto, kandi yaayorekwa abyami aha kitanda kye. Bwanyima yaahandiika eki arootsire, yaakishoboorora omu bigambo bigufu. <verse eid="DAN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:1">Kush 7:1</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaagira ati: Ekiro kimwe nkoorekwa, naareeba emiyaga ena y'omu iguru neetabangura enyanja mpango. <verse eid="DAN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1">Kush 13:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuri egyo nyanja haarugamu enyamaishwa mpango ina ezitarikushushana. <verse eid="DAN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />Ey'okubanza ekaba neeshusha entare kandi eine amapapa g'empungu. KU naabaire nkigihangire amaisho, amapapa gaayo gaakuurwa, yaimukibwa, yaayemerera n'ebigyere bibiri nk'omuntu, kandi yaaheebwa obwengye n'abantu. <verse eid="DAN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:39">Dan 2:39</ref>. </char></note> Naagaruka naareeba endiijo nyamaishwa ya kabiri, erikushusha edubu. Etunguukire orubaju rumwe, eine embaju ishatu omu maino; baagiragiira bati: Imuka, oshonshomere enyama nyingi. <verse eid="DAN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:2">Kush 13:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'ekyo naareeba endiijo nyamaishwa erikushusha engwe, eine amapapa g'empungu aha mugongo. Egyo nyamaishwa ekaba eine emitwe ena, kandi yaaheebwa obutegyeki. <verse eid="DAN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:7">Kush 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:1">13:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'ekyo naagaruka naareeba omu kworekwa kwa nyekiro enyamaishwa ya kana erikutiinisa, erikwitsa obwoba, kandi ey'amaani agatakareebwaga. Ekaba eine ebiino by'ebyoma, yaashonshomera ebintu, yaabihendagura, n'ebyatsigaraho yaabiteera emigyere. Ekaba eine omutaano n'enyamaishwa zoona ezaagibandiize; kandi eine amahembe ikumi. <verse eid="DAN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:5">Kush 13:5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 13:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Ku naabaire ninkyetegyereza ago mahembe, naareeba gaamerwamu erindi ihembe eryabaire riri rikye; amahembe ashatu omu g'okubanza gaakuuka n'emizi omu maisho gaaryo. Kandi reeba, omuri eryo ihembe rikye hakaba harimu amaisho garikushusha ag'omuntu, n'akanwa akarikugamba ebintu bikuru.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:19">1 Bag 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:2">Zab 90:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:16">Ezk 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:9">10:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 28:3">28:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:14">Kush 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:4">20:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naabaire ninkyetegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Naareeba ebitebe by'obukama byateebwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Omukuru owa iranaira yaashutama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Ebijwaro bye bikaba nibyera nk'orubaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Kandi eishokye rye niryerera kimwe nk'ebyoya by'entaama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Ekitebe ky'obukama bwe kiri endimi z'omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Kandi n'enziga zaakyo ziri omuriro ogurikwaka.<verse eid="DAN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:3">Zab 50:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:22">Heb 12:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:11">Kush 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:18">11:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:12">20:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu maisho ge haarugamu omugyera gw'omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Rukumi emirundi enkumi baamuheereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">N'akakumi emirundi obukumi baayemerera omu maisho ge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Emanja zaatandika kuhurirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Ebitabo byashuuruurwa.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 13:5">Kush 13:5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 13:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:20">19:20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:10">20:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri ako kaanya naareeba kandi naatangaara ahabw'eiraka ry'eryo ihembe eryabaire nirigamba ebintu bikuru. Ku naabaire ninkyetegyereza, egyo nyamaishwa yaitwa, omutumbi gwayo gwacwekyerezibwa, gwaheebwayo kwokibwa omu muriro. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Ezindi nyamaishwa ezaatsigaireho zaihwaho obutegyeki, kwonka zaarekyerwa amagara gaazo kumara omwanya n'obunaku. <verse eid="DAN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:26">Mak 13:26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:62">14:62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:27">Yoh 5:27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:34">12:34</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Kush 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:14">14:14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naareeba omuri okwo kworekwa nyekiro, kandi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:13">Reeba, Orikushusha omwana w'omuntu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:13">Yaija n'ebicu by'omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:13">Yaahika Ogwo mukuru owa iranaira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:13">Yaamurikwa omu maisho ge;<verse eid="DAN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zab 110:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 110:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 9:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2:44</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mat 28:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:33">Luk 1:33</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:15">Kush 11:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaaheebwa obutegyeki, ekitiinisa n'obukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:14">Ngu abantu b'amahanga goona, n'enganda zoona z'endimi ezitari zimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:14">Bagume bamuheereze;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:14">Obutegyeki bwe n'obutegyeki bw'ebiro byona obutarihwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:14">Kandi n'obukama bwe n'obukama obutarimarwaho.<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amakuru g'ekyo kirooto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />Kwonka nyowe, Danieli, omutima gwanyemerera, n'ebi nyorekirwe byantiinisa. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />Nairira haihi omwe ahari abo abaabaire beemereire aho, naamubuuza amazima g'ebyo byona. Atyo yangambira, yanshobororera amakuru gaabyo, <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />naagira ati: Ezo nyamaishwa mpango ina nibo bagabe bana, abariimuka omu nsi. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18, 22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:34">Mat 25:34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:2">1 Kor 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:26">Kush 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:4">20:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:5">22:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abarikwera ba Rukira-boona nibo bariheebwa obukama, bukaba obwabo okuhitsya ryari na ryari.<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />Bwanyima naayetenga kumanya amazima g'eby'enyamaishwa ya kana, eyaabaire eine omutaano n'ezindi zoona, neetiinisa munonga, ebiino byayo biri eby'ebyoma, n'ebyara byayo biri eby'emiringa, eyaashonshomeire ebintu ekabihendagura, kandi ebyatsigaireho ekabiteera omugyere; <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />kandi n'okumanya eby'ago mahembe ikumi agaabaire gari aha mutwe gwayo, n'eby'erindi ihembe eryamezire bwanyima, ashatu omuri gari gakakuurwa omu maisho gaaryo; n'eihembe eryabaire riine amaisho n'akanwa karikugamba ebintu bikuru, eryareebekire nirikira magyenzi gaaryo. <verse eid="DAN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:7">Kush 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:7">13:7</ref>. </char></note> Ku naabaire ninkyetegyereza, eryo ihembe ryarwanisa abarikwera, ryaguma niribabinga, <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />okuhitsya obu Ogwo Mukuru owa iranaira yaizire, abarikwera ba Rukira-boona bakasinga orubaja, obunaku bukahika, abarikwera bakaheebwa obukama.<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />Atyo ogwo muntu yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:23">Eby'egyo nyamaishwa ya kana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:23">Haryabaho obugabe bwa kana omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:23">Obutarishushana na bundi bugabe bwona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:23">Buryashonshomera ensi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:23">Bugiribatiirire, bugicwanyagurire kimwe.<verse eid="DAN 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 17:12">Kush 17:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi eby'amahembe ikumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:24">Omuri obwo bugabe haryaimukamu abagabe ikumi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:24">Bwanyima yaabo haimukye ondiijo mugabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:24">Abe ow'omutaano aha baamubandiize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:24">Kandi bashatu ahari abo aryabagarura ahansi.<verse eid="DAN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">12:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:14">Kush 12:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo niwe arigamba eby'okugomera Rukira-boona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:25">Kandi aryanyangaraza abarikwera ba Rukira-boona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:25">Agire enaama y'okuhindura obunaku n'ebiragiro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:25">Kandi biryarekwa omu mikono ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:25">Okuhitsya obu obunaku, obunaku bubiri, n'ekicweka ky'obunaku birihwaho.<verse eid="DAN 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan 7:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka bwanyima emanja ziryatandika kuhurirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:26">Bamwiheho obutegyeki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:26">Abone kuhwerekyerezibwa n'okumarirwaho kimwe okuhitsya aha muheru.<verse eid="DAN 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2:44</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:15">Kush 11:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reero bwanyima obukama n'obutegyeki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:27">N'obukuru bw'amahanga agari ahansi y'eiguru ryona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:27">Biryaheebwa eihanga ry'abarikwera ba Rukira-boona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:27">Obukama bwabo buryaba obukama obutarihwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:27">Kandi obugabe bwona buryaguma bubaheereze, buboorobere.<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:27">Dan 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:19">Luk 2:19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 2:51">51</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha niho ebyo byagarukira; kwonka nyowe, Danieli, ebiteekateeko bikandeetera kwemereza omutima, naahinduriza ahamaisho; kwonka ekyo kigambo naakigumya omu mutima gwangye.<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Danieli okworekwa empaya y'entaama n'ey'embuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />Omu mwaka gwa kashatu ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Belishaza, nyowe Danieli nkareeba okworekwa, okwabaire nikukurata okw'okubanza. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:1">Neh 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Naareeba ebintu omu kworekwa. Obwo nkaba ndi omu rurembo Shushani, oruri omu ishaza rya Elamu. Omuri okwo kworekwa naareeba ndi aha mugyera Ulai. <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:20">Dan 8:20</ref>. </char></note> Ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba empaya y'entaama eyemereire aha nkungu y'omugyera. Egyo mpaya ekaba eine amahembe abiri, gombi gakaba gari maraingwa, kwonka erimwe niryeshumba erindi; kandi eriraingwa niryo ryamezire bwanyima. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Naareeba egyo mpaya neegyenda neeshengura busha aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho n'obwa buryo; hakaba hatariho nyamaishwa erikubaasa kugiza omu kaso, n'obu yaakuba orikubaasa kugijuna ekintu; yaaguma neeyegirira nk'oku erikwenda, eine eigundu.<verse eid="DAN 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:21">Dan 8:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naabaire ninkyetegyereza, reeba haija empaya y'embuzi neeruga oburengyerwa-izooba, yaacwekanisa ensi yoona etarikuhitsya maguru hansi; kandi egyo mpaya ekaba eine eihembe eririkureebeka munonga ahagati y'amaisho gaayo. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:20">Dan 8:20</ref>. </char></note> Yaahika empaya y'entaama ey'amahembe abiri, ei naareebire eyemereire aha nkungu y'omugyera, yaagisyokyera n'amaani eine ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />Naareeba neegiiririra, yaagigirira ekiniga, yaagishengura, yaagikooboraho ago mahembe gombi; egyo mpaya y'entaama yaabura agagigaruka omu kaso, kureka egyo mpaya y'embuzi yaagituura ahansi, yaagiribatiirira; haabura owaabaasa kugigikiza. <verse eid="DAN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:21">Dan 8:21</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 8:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho egyo mpaya y'embuzi yaagirira kimwe eigundu; kwonka ku yaakuzire yaahama, eryo ihembe rihango ryacweka, omu mwanya gwaryo haameramu agandi mahembe ana agarikureeba ei emiyaga y'omu iguru ena eruga.<verse eid="DAN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:8">Dan 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:6">Ezk 20:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rimwe ahari ago mahembe ryatookwaho akandi kahembe, kaakura, kaaba eihembe rihango munonga, ryatoora aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, n'aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, n'omu nsi y'ekitiinisa. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13">Isa 14:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:4">Kush 12:4</ref>. </char></note> Ryaba rihango, ryahika n'eihe ry'omu iguru, kandi enyonyoozi zimwe ez'omuri eryo ihe ryazinaga ahansi, ryaziribatiirira. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:31">Dan 11:31</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Rityo ryayetunguura, ryayeinganisa n'Omukuru w'eryo ihe; ryamwihaho ekitambo ky'okwotsya eky'obutoosha, kandi Omwanya ogurikwera gwasheenywa. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Ryaheebwa eryo ihe hamwe n'ekitambo ky'okwotsya eky'obutoosha ekitambwa ahabw'okushiisha. Amazima gaanagwa ahansi; eryo ihembe ryagyenderwa gye omu bi ryabaire nirikora. <verse eid="DAN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:13">Dan 4:13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:24-27">9:24-27</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naahurira orikwera naagamba; kandi orikwera ondiijo yaamubuuza ati: Ebyo ebyayorekwa eby'ekitambo ky'okwotsya eky'obutoosha, n'eby'eky'okushiisha ekirikuhindura ensi amatongo, n'eby'okurekura Obutaaho oburikwera n'eryo ihe kuribatiirirwa, biryagarukira hi? <verse eid="DAN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Biryamara ebiro enkumi ibiri na magana ashatu nibusheesha nibwira; bwanyima Obutaaho oburikwera bugarukye aha buteeka bwabwo.<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amakuru g'ebi Danieli yaayorekirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:16">10:16</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:26">Ezk 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:10">1 Pet 1:10</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 1:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:13">Kush 1:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe Danieli, ku naaherize kureeba okwo kworekwa, naateeraho kukwetegyereza; ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba ekirikushusha omuntu kundumbaire omu maisho. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:21">Dan 9:21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:5-7">12:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:19">Luk 1:19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Naahurira eiraka ry'omuntu niriruga ahagati y'omugyera Ulai, yaayeta naagira ati: Gaburieli, shobororera ogwo mushaija ebi yaayorekwa. <verse eid="DAN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:28">Ezk 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 2:1">2:1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:35">Dan 11:35</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:40">40</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:4">12:4</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:12">Luk 1:12</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yairira ahu naabaire nyemereire. Ku yaizire, naatiina, naayetuura ahansi njuumaire. Kwonka yangira ati: Iwe mwana w'omuntu 'we, yetegyereze ku ebi waayorekwa biri eby'obunaku bw'aha mperu.<verse eid="DAN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 10:9">Dan 10:9</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:32">Luk 9:32</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Kush 1:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabaire naakingambira, naagwejegyerera kimwe njuumaire; kwonka yankoraho, yaanyimutsya, naayemerera; <verse eid="DAN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11:36</ref>. </char></note> yaagira ati: Reeba, naaza kukumanyisa ebiribaho omu bunaku bw'aha muheru obw'okugirirwa ekiniga, ahabw'okuba n'eby'obunaku bw'aha muheru obwatairweho. <verse eid="DAN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />Eby'empaya y'entaama ey'amahembe abiri, ei waareeba, nibo bagabe babiri aba Bumeedi na Buperesi; <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:5">Dan 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:20">10:20</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:3">11:3</ref>. </char></note> kandi egyo mpaya y'embuzi niwe mugabe wa Bugriika; n'eryo ihembe rihango ery'ahagati y'amaisho gaayo niwe mugabe waabwo ow'okubanza. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:8">Dan 8:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nk'oku ryacweka, omu mwanya gwaryo hakameramu agandi mahembe ana, nikwo haribaho obugabe buna oburikuruga omuri eryo ihanga; kwonka buryaba butaine maani nk'ag'ogwo mugabe w'okubanza. <verse eid="DAN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />Omu bunaku bw'aha muheru gw'obwo bugabe buna, abasiisi ku bariba baherize kushiisha bakarengyesereza, omugabe ow'ahamaisho aharikutiinisa, orikumanya ebitarikumanywa, aryaimuka. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan 7:21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:28">11:28</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">12:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:17">Kush 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:18">Isa 63:18</ref>. </char></note> Obushoboorozi bwe buryaba bwingi, aryareeta okucwekyerera okurikutiinisa, agyenderwe gye omu bi arikukora, acwekyereze abashaija b'amaani n'eihanga ry'abarikwera. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:11">Dan 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:21">11:21</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuhwetahweteka kwe obugobya buryamubaasisa kukora ebi arikwenda; aryayehimbisa omu mutima gwe. Aryacwekyereza baingi batabwirwe; kandi aryaimuka kurwanisa n'Omukama w'abakama; kwonka aryahendagurika hataine omukozireho. <verse eid="DAN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:14">Dan 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:14">10:14</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:4">12:4</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 10:4">Kush 10:4</ref>. </char></note> Ebyayorekirwe bikagambwa ku biribaho, omu busheeshe n'omu myabazyo n'eby'amazima; kwonka orinde okwo kworekwa, ahabw'okuba n'okw'ebiro ebiriizira ira.<verse eid="DAN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:28">Dan 7:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe Danieli naaraba, naamara ebiro ndwaire; bwanyima naimuka, naakora emirimo y'omugabe; kwonka naatangaazibwa ebyo ebi naayorekirwe; kandi tihaine waabyetegyereize.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Danieli okushabira eihanga rye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 5:30">Dan 5:30</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:1">11:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwa Dario mwene Ahasuero, ow'omu ruganda rw'Abameedi, owaahindukire omugabe w'Abakaludaaya <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:1">Ezr 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:12">Yer 25:12</ref>. </char></note> omuri ogwo mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwe, nyowe Danieli nkamanyira omu bitabo emyaka ei Yerusaalemu erimara ekasheenywa, ku eri emyaka makumi mushanju, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyahanwirwe nabi Yeremia oku kyabaire kiri.<verse eid="DAN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 1:4">Neh 1:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naata amaisho ahari Mukama Ruhanga wangye, nimmusherurira omu kushaba n'okweshengyereza, naayesiibyakwo njwaire ebiguniya, nyesiigire eiju. <verse eid="DAN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Kur 34:6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:40">Lev 26:40</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9">Bir 7:9</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:5">Neh 1:5</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 1:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:32">9:32</ref>. </char></note> Naashaba MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye, naamwaturira ningira nti: Ai Mukama, Ruhanga omukuru kandi orikutiinisa, ohikiiriza endagaano, kandi ogirira embabazi abarikukukunda, bakoorobera ebiragiro byawe. <verse eid="DAN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:47">1 Bag 8:47</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:42">Tonz 3:42</ref>. </char></note> Manya tukashiisha, twacumura, twakora ebitari by'okuhikiirira, twagoma, twateishuka, twareka ebiragiro byawe n'ebyatairweho; <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15">2 Bus 36:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:11">Ezr 9:11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:34">Neh 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:25">Yer 7:25</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:6">Zek 1:6</ref>. </char></note> kandi twayanga kuhurira abaheereza baawe baanabi, abaabaire bagambira abagabe baitu, abategyeki baitu, baatatenkuriitwe, n'abantu boona ab'omu nsi yaitu omu iziina ryawe. <verse eid="DAN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:40">Lev 26:40</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:18">Tonz 1:18</ref>. </char></note> Ai Mukama, okuhikiirira n'okwawe, kwonka ekyaitu n'okwitwa enshoni, nk'oku kiri eri izooba aha bashaija ba Yuda, n'abatwire Yerusaalemu, n'aha Baisraeli boona, ahari abo abari haihi, n'abo abari hare omu nsi zoona ei waababingiire ahabw'okucumura oku baakucumwireho. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />Ai Mukama, itwe n'abagabe baitu, n'abategyeki baitu, na baatatenkuriitwe, ekyaitu n'okwitwa enshoni, ahabw'okuba tukakucumuraho. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:17">Neh 9:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:15">Zab 86:15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Mukama Ruhanga waitu niwe wenka ogira embabazi n'okusaasira, n'obu turaabe twamugomeire, <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:4">Yer 26:4</ref>, <ref loc="JER 26:5">5</ref>. </char></note> tutoorobere Mukama Ruhanga waitu, tukanga kukuratira ebiragiro bye, ebi yaataire omu maisho gaitu naabirabya omu baheereza be baanabi. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:14-45">Lev 26:14-45</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Bir 28:15-68</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 10:29">Neh 10:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:4-6">Isa 1:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 40:3">Yer 40:3</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima, Abaisraeli boona bakashiisha ebiragiro byawe, baateishuka, baatoora ahandi, baayanga kuhurira eiraka ryawe. Nikyo omukyeeno n'endahiro ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebiragiro bya Musa omuheereza wa Ruhanga bitushukiirweho, ahabw'okuba tukamucumuraho. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:16">Yer 39:16</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:12">Tonz 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:9">Ezk 5:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ahamize ebigambo bye ebi yaagambire naatuhana, itwe n'abategyeki baitu abaabaire nibatutegyeka, ahabw'okutureetaho akabi kahango; ahabw'okuba ahansi y'eiguru tihariho kirakozirwe nk'ekyo ekyakozirwe ahari Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Akabi ako koona katuhikireho, nk'oku kihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebiragiro bya Musa; n'obu kiraabe kibaire kityo, MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, titukweshengyereize, ngu otugirire embabazi, kandi titurekire by'okutahikiirira byaitu, tukamanya amazima gaawe. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:33">Neh 9:33</ref>; <ref loc="JER 1:12">Yer 1:12</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA ateekateekyeire akabi aka, akakatureetaho; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu n'ohikiriire omuri byona ebi akora, kwonka itwe titworobeire iraka rye. <verse eid="DAN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:18">Kur 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:11">32:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:21">Bir 6:21</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:10">Neh 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:10">9:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:20">Yer 32:20</ref>, <ref loc="JER 32:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, ai Mukama Ruhanga waitu, owaihire abantu baawe omu nsi ya Misri n'omukono gw'amaani, okeetungira eiziina, nk'oku kiri hati, tukacumura, twakora ebitari by'okuhikiirira. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 79:4">Zab 79:4</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:5">Tonz 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:15">2:15</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 2:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:4">Ezk 36:4</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:45">Dan 11:45</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:16">Mik 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:3">Zek 8:3</ref>. </char></note> Ai Mukama, ninkweshengyereza ahabw'eby'okuhikiirira byona ebi okora, okubiihirwa kwawe n'ekiniga kyawe birugye aha rurembo rwawe Yerusaalemu, orushozi rwawe orurikwera; ahabw'okuba Yerusaalemu n'abantu baawe bahindukire eky'okucweraho enfumu omu bantu boona abatwehinguririize ahabw'ebibi byaitu n'ahabw'eby'okushiisha bya baatatenkuriitwe. <verse eid="DAN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:25">Kub 6:25</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:18">Tonz 5:18</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, ai Ruhanga waitu, hurira okushaba n'okweshengyereza kw'omwiru waawe, kandi, ai Mukama, ahabw'ekitiinisa kyawe Omwanya gwawe ogurikwera, ogubaire gwabaire omushaka, ogwakize amaisho gaawe. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:16">2 Bag 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:19">Neh 9:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:29">Yer 25:29</ref>. </char></note> Ai Ruhanga wangye, tega okutu kwawe, ohurire; igura amaisho gaawe, oreebe okweshobera kwaitu, n'orurembo orurikwetererwa eiziina ryawe; ahabw'okuba titurikukureetera kweshengyereza kwaitu ahabw'okwesiga okuhikiirira kwaitu, kureka ahabw'okwesiga embabazi zaawe. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 70:5">Zab 70:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:9">Yer 14:9</ref>. </char></note> Ai MUKAMA, hurira; ai MUKAMA, saasira; ai MUKAMA, taho omutima, okore; ai Ruhanga wangye, ahabwawe otakyerererwa, ahabw'okuba orurembo rwawe n'abantu baawe nibeetererwa eiziina ryawe.<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:24">Isa 65:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naabaire ninkigamba kandi ninkishaba, niinyatura ebibi byangye n'eby'abantu bangye Abaisraeli, nindeetera MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye okweshengyereza kwangye ahabw'orushozi rwa Ruhanga wangye orurikwera; <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 8:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 29:39">Kur 29:39</ref>. </char></note> ninkigamba ninshaba, omushaija Gaburieli, ou naareebire omu kworekwa kw'okubanza, yaagaruka, yaija naayehuuta, yampikaho, <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:17">Dan 1:17</ref>. </char></note> yanshobororera naagira ati: Iwe Danieli, hati naija kukuha obwengye n'okwetegyereza. <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:11">Dan 10:11</ref>. </char></note> Obu waaba nootandika kweshengyereza, haija ekigambo; mbwenu naija kukikugambira, ahakuba ori orikukundwa munonga. N'ahabw'ekyo teekateeka ahari ekyo kigambo, oyetegyereze okwo kworekwa.<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 11:1">Neh 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:34">Yer 31:34</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:25">Rom 3:25</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 3:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:17">Heb 2:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saabiiti makumi mushanju ziteirweho ahabw'abantu baawe n'orurembo rwawe orurikwera, ngu ebicumuro bihwe, ebibi biihweho, okutahikiirira kurihiirirwe, haije okuhikiirira okutarihwaho, ebyorekirwe n'ebyahanwirwe baanabi biteebweho akamanyiso, n'Orikwera munonga ashukweho amajuta. <verse eid="DAN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:23">2 Bus 36:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:3">Ezr 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:18">Zab 51:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:41">Yoh 1:41</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, omanye kandi oyetegyereze, ngu okwiha aha kiragiro ky'okuhunduura n'okwombeka Yerusaalemu okuhitsya aha kwija kw'Omunyiginya owaashukirweho amajuta, haryabaho saabiiti mushanju. Bwanyima omu saabiiti makumi mukaaga na ibiri egarukye eyombekwe, egire enguuto n'enteeraniro zaazo, kwonka bikorwe omu biro by'emirabanamu. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:2">Mak 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:43">Luk 19:43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:44">44</ref>. </char></note> Ezo saabiiti makumi mukaaga na ibiri kuzirihwaho, Owaashukirweho amajuta aryaihwaho, kandi tarigira ki aritsigaza. Abantu b'omutegyeki oriija baryacwekyereza orurembo n'Omwanya ogurikwera; omuheru gwe guryaba okutwarwa omwegyemure; kandi habeho obweme okuhitsya aha muheru. Eby'okuhwerekyereza biragiirwe. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:23">Isa 10:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14">Mak 13:14</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mutegyeki aryaragaana na baingi endagaano ehamire, emare saabiiti emwe. Omu kicweka ky'okubanza ky'egyo saabiiti aryazibira abantu kutamba ebitambo n'okuhonga empongano. Bwanyima omuhwerekyerezi aryaizira aha ipapa ry'ebirikuzira, okuhitsya obu omuheru gwe ogwaragiirwe gurimuhikaho.<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Danieli okureeba ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 1:7">Dan 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 1:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:28">6:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kashatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Kuuro omugabe wa Buperesi ekigambo kikashuuruurirwa Danieli owaayetsirwe Beliteeshaza. Kandi ekyo kigambo kikaba kiri eky'amazima, nikimanyisa eby'orugamba rw'amaani. Yaakyetegyereza, ebi yaayorekirwe byamushoborokyera.<verse eid="DAN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Omu biro ebyo, nyowe Danieli nkamara saabiiti ishatu ninganya; <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:17">Mat 6:17</ref>. </char></note> kandi omu saabiiti ezo zoona tindariire k'okurya koona akanuzire; enyama n'obu yaakuba viinyo tibirahikire mu kanwa kangye, kandi tindeerabizeho kajuta koona. <verse eid="DAN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:14">Kut 2:14</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bina omu kwezi kw'okubanza, nkaba nyemereire aha nkungu y'omugyera ogurikwetwa Hidekeeli; <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:9">Yer 10:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 9:2">Ezk 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:6">Kush 15:6</ref>. </char></note> ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba omushaija ojwaire omwenda gwa kitaani, ayezirikiise orukoba rw'ezaabu nungi eya Ufaazi. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:14">Ezk 1:14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 28:3">Mat 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:14">Kush 1:14</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:6">19:6</ref>. </char></note> Omubiri gwe gukaba nigushusha berulo, aha maisho ge nihashusha omurabyo, maisho ge nigashusha amatabaaza g'omuriro, emikono ye n'amaguru ge nibyengyengyeta nk'omuringa ogweziibwe, n'eiraka rye riri nk'ery'abantu baingi. <verse eid="DAN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:7">Byak 9:7</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe nyenka, Danieli, niinye naareebire okwo kworekwa; abantu abu naabaire nyine tibarakureebire, kwonka bakatetema munonga, baahunga baaza kweshereka. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:28">Dan 7:28</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naatsigara nyenka, naareeba okwo kworekwa kuhango, omuriinye tihaatsigaramu twani twona, n'oburungi bwangye bwahindukira kimwe obujunde, amaani gampweramu kimwe. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:18">Dan 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Kush 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naamuhurira naagamba; ku naahuriire eiraka rye, naagwa ahansi njuumaire, naagwejegyerera kimwe, omutwe ngucurikire okuzimu.<verse eid="DAN 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Kandi reeba, omukono gwankoraho, gwantsiga nintetema, ntsimbire emikono n'amaju. <verse eid="DAN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:23">Dan 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 2:1">Ezk 2:1</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Iwe Danieli omushaija orikukundwa munonga, ta omutima aha bi ndikukugambira, kandi oyemerere gye; ahabw'okuba naakutumwaho. Ku yaabaire naakingambira ekyo kigambo, naayemerera nintetema. <verse eid="DAN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:4">Byak 10:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Kush 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yangira ati: Danieli, otatiina, ahakuba okwiha aha izooba eri otandikiireho kutaho omutima kwetegyereza n'okwecureeza omu maisho ga Ruhanga waawe, ebigambo byawe bihuriirwe; kandi nikyo kyandeeta. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:2">Dan 10:2</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:9">Yud 9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Kush 12:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka maraika w'obugabe bwa Buperesi amazire ebiro makumi abiri na kimwe ankumiriire; bwanyima Mikaeli, omwe ahari baamaraika abakuru, yaija kumpa emikono; ntyo naamutsigaho n'ogwo mukuru w'obugabe bwa Buperesi, <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:26">Dan 8:26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:1">Kut 49:1</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:3">Hab 2:3</ref>. </char></note> naija kukushobororera ebiriba aha bantu baawe omu biro bya bwanyima; ahabw'okuba okwo kworekwa n'okw'ebiro ebiriija.<verse eid="DAN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />Ku yaaherize kungambira ebyo bigambo, naajuumara ahansi, naagobwa orurimi. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16, 18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:15">Dan 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 1:9">Yer 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:7">Isa 6:7</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima reeba, haija orikushusha abaana b'abantu, yankora aha minwa; nikwo kwashamya akanwa kangye, nkagamba, ningira owaabaire anyemereire omu maisho, nti: Mukama wangye, ebi nyorekirwe bindeeteire obusaasi, naahweramu kimwe amaani. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />Mbwenu nkaanye omwiru waawe, Mukama wangye, nimbaasa kugamba naiwe? Ahabw'okuba tinkiine twani twona, n'omwitsyo gwampweiremu.<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Kandi owaabire naashusha omuntu yankoraho, yangaruramu amaani; <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:23">Dan 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:23">Bar 6:23</ref>. </char></note> yangira ati: Iwe mushaija orikukundwa munonga 'we, otatiina, huumura; garukwamu amaani, ogume omutima. Ku yangambiire atyo, naagarukwamu amaani, naagira nti: Mukama wangye, k'ogambe, ahabw'okuba wangaruramu amaani. <verse eid="DAN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:21">Dan 8:21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:13">10:13</ref>. </char></note> Yambuuza ati: Noomanya ekyandeeta ahariiwe? Reeba, hati naaza kugarukayo kurwana na maraika wa Buperesi; kandi ku ndiheza kumusingura, maraika wa Bugriika aryaija. <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka niinyija kukugambira ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'amazima; kandi tihariho ondiijo ou ndikukwatanisa nawe kubarwanisa, okwihaho Mikaeli maraika waanyu.<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Orugamba rw'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, n'ow'aha bwa-buryo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:1">Dan 9:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nyowe, omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwa Dario Omumeedi, nkaimuka kumugumya n'okumugaruramu amaani.<verse eid="DAN 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:21">Dan 8:21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:21">10:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu hati naaza kukworeka amazima. Reeba, omuri Buperisi haryaimukamu abandi bagabe bashatu, kandi owa kana aryakiriza kimwe abo bonshatu obutungi; ku ariheza kugira amaani ahabw'obutungi bwe, aryimutsya engabo ze zoona kurwanisa obugabe wa Bugriika. <verse eid="DAN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />Bwanyima haryayema omugabe rugambwa, ategyekyese obushoboorozi bwingi, atwaze nk'oku arikwenda. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Ku ariheza kuhama, obugabe bwe buryacwekamu ebicweka, bubaganisibwemu nibutoora ei emiyaga ena y'omu iguru ereetwa; kandi tiburihungurwa ruzaaro rwe, n'obu kwakuba okugaruka aha buteeka nk'oku yaabaire naakibutegyeka, ahabw'okuba obugabe bwe buryarandurwa, butwarwe abandi abatari abo.<verse eid="DAN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />Bwanyima omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo aryagira amaani; kwonka omwe aha bakuru b'engabo ze aryamukiza amaani, kandi obugabe bwe buryaba buhango. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Ku harihinguraho emyaka, baryakwatanisa; bwanyima muhara w'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo aryaza owa omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho kuragaana endagaano y'okugarukana; kwonka ogwo mwishiki tariguma na maani g'obushoboorozi bwe, n'omushaija we tarigumaho n'obu rwakuba oruzaaro rwe, kureka ogwo mwishiki n'abaragaragwa be n'omwana we n'omushaija owaamushweire baryaheebwayo.<verse eid="DAN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />Kwonka ebiro ebyo, omwe ow'omu ruzaaro rw'ogwo mwishiki, orikumukomookaho, aryaimuka, ahungurire ishenkuru; aryarwanisa ihe ryabo, ataahe omu kigo ky'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, abarwanise, abasingure. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />Aryanyaga baaruhanga baabo, n'ebishushani byabo ebiheesirwe, n'ebintu byabo by'obuguzi bwingi eby'efeeza n'eby'ezaabu, abitware Misri. Kandi aryamara emyaka atarikuteera mugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Bwanyima ogwo mugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho aryateera ensi y'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, kwonka aryagaruka atyo omu nsi ye. <verse eid="DAN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:40">Dan 11:40</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:8">Isa 8:8</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abatabani baryahuruza abantu, bateerane engabo nyingi munonga; ezo ngabo ziryateera ensi, zigijanjaare yoona, zoogyemu, zigumizemu nizirwana, zihikye n'aha kigo ky'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo. <verse eid="DAN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />Ekirirugamu, ogwo mugabe aryagira ekiniga, ahurure, arwane n'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. Ogwo mugabe aryahuruza eihe rihango munonga, kwonka riryakwatwa abazigu be. <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, ku ariheza kukwata ezo ngabo, aryayetunguura, aziitemu obukumi n'obukumi, kwonka taribasingurira kimwe; <verse eid="DAN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />ahakuba omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho aryagaruka, ahuruze eihe rihango munonga eririkukira ery'okubanza; ku harihinguraho emyaka, aryahurura n'engabo nyingi n'ebintu bingi.<verse eid="DAN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />Omuri obwo bunaku baingi baryaimuka kurwanisa omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, n'ababisha b'omu ihanga ryawe baryaimuka kuhikiiriza ebyayorekirwe, kwonka baryaremwa. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Bwanyima omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho aryaija, agote orurembo orwehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare ezigumire, arurundeho eby'okutemberaho, arukwate. Engabo z'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, nangwa n'ez'entoore, tiziribaasa, ahabw'okuba tizirigira garwana. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:9">Dan 8:9</ref>. </char></note> Kureka oriija kumurwanisa, aryakora nk'oku arikwenda, kandi tihariho orimuza omu kaso; bwanyima aryayemerera omu nsi y'ekitiinisa, yoona eze omu bushoboorozi bwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />Aryamariirira kuhuruza engabo z'obugabe bwe bwona, aragaane n'ogwo mugabe ebyakubaasa kureeta obusingye, abihikiirize. Aryahingira omugabe wa Misri muhara we, ngu abone kushiisha obwo bugabe. Kwonka enaama ye terihikiirira, kandi terigira ki yaamugasira. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Bwanyima aryahinduka ateere ebirwa, akubuure bingi; kwonka omukuru w'eihe ondiijo aryamaraho emyekuniko ye; kandi egyo myekuniko ye nayo emuhindukane, emushongye. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Bwanyima aryahindukira ebigo by'omu nsi ye, kwonka aryateera entsibo, agwe aburire kimwe.<verse eid="DAN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />Bwanyima haryaimuka ondiijo omu mwanya gwe, ayohereze orikushoza omushoro, arabe omu nsi y'ekitiinisa; kwonka ku harihinguraho ebiro bikye, nawe aryacwekyerezibwa, ataitsirwe na kiniga, n'obu kwakuba okugwa omu rugamba. <verse eid="DAN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />Omu mwanya gwe haryaimuka omuntu orikugaywa, otakaheebwaga kitiinisa ky'obugabe; aryaija atamanyirwe, aheebwe obugabe ahabw'okwesiigisiriza. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Amahe garyatwarirwa kimwe omu maisho ge, gataataane, kandi n'Omukuru w'endagaano nawe abe atyo. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />Kandi ku bariheza kuragaana nawe endagaano, aryakora eby'obugobya, ahindukye ow'amaani, haza aine abantu bakye. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />Bwanyima aryateera ekicweka ky'egyo nsi ekirikukira oburungi atamanyirwe, akore eki baishe na baishenkuru batarakozire, abaganisize abantu be emicwijuro n'eminyago n'eby'obutungi. Kandi aryagira enaama z'okuteera ebigo byayo ebigumire, kwonka okumara akaanya kakye. <verse eid="DAN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />Bwanyima ayeteere ebinyomyo, agire obumanzi bw'okurwanisa omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo n'eihe ringi; ogwo mugabe aryahurura n'eihe rihango munonga kandi ery'amaani; kwonka tarigumaho, ahabw'okuba baryamugirira enaama mbi. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Nangwa n'abariba batungirwe eby'okurya bye nibo barimucwekyereza; eihe rye riryatwarwa, kandi baingi omuriryo baitwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:40">Dan 11:40</ref>. </char></note> Abo bagabe bombi emitima yaabo eryararamira okukora eby'eitima; baryaguma nibabeihana bashutami aha meeza emwe, kwonka ebyo biryaba ebya busha, ahabw'okuba omuheru gwabyo guryabaho omu bunaku bwagwo obwatairweho. <verse eid="DAN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Bwanyima aryagaruka omu nsi ye n'ebintu bingi, kandi omutima gwe guryaba nigukyanga endagaano erikwera. Aryakora eki arikwenda, agarukye omu nsi ye.<verse eid="DAN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />Omu bunaku obwatairweho aryagaruka omu nsi y'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, agiteere, kwonka omu bunaku obwo tikiriba nk'oku kyabaire bwabiso; <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />ahabw'okuba emeeri za Kitimu ziryaija kumurwanisa; nikyo aritiinira, akagarurayo engabo ze, akagyenda aine ekiniga kingi, akarwansia abarikukunda endagaano erikwera. Omu kugaruka kwe aryata omutima ahari abo abarikureka endagaano erikwera. <verse eid="DAN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:13">Dan 8:13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14">Mak 13:14</ref>. </char></note> Aryayohereza engabo ze, zihikyeyo, zishiishe hekalu n'ekigo kyayo, ziiheho ekitambo ky'okwotsya eky'obutoosha, ziteho ekirikuzira ekirikuhwerekyereza. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />Abarikushiisha egyo ndagaano aryababeihabeihesa akarimi karungi; kwonka abantu abarikumanya Ruhanga waabo baryahama, bakore eby'obumanzi. <verse eid="DAN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:3">Dan 12:3</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Abaine obwengye omuri abo bantu, n'obu barimara ebiro bingi nibaitwa rurara n'omuriro, bakatwarwa bari enkwatwa banyagirwe, baryareetera baingi okwetegyereza. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Ku barigwa, baryatunga okuhwerwa kukye; baingi baryayeteerana nabo nibamamarika. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:3">Mal 3:3</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 3:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Kush 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bamwe omuri abo banyabwengye baryaitwa, bamarwemu enkamba, bashemezibwe, kandi beezibwe, okuhitsya aha bunaku bw'aha muheru; ahabw'okuba obunaku obwatairweho buryaba butakahikire.<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Bir 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:25">Isa 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:27">9:27</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:4">2 Tes 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5">Kush 13:5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 13:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ogwo mugabe aryakora nk'oku arikwenda, ayetunguure, ayekuze okukira baaruhanga boona, agambe ebirikutangaaza eby'okurogota ahari Ruhanga Nyamuhanga. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Kandi ogwo mugabe taryeta hari baaruhanga ba baishenkuru, nari okwetenga abakazi n'obu kyakuba ekyetwa ruhanga kyona, ahakuba aryayekuza okukira boona. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />Omu mwanya gw'okuha baaruhanga abo ekitiinisa aryakiha ruhanga w'ebigo; kandi ruhanga ou baishenkuru baabaire batakamanyaga, niwe ariha ekitiinisa, naamutoijera ezaabu, efeeza, obubaare bw'obuguzi bwingi, n'ebiconco ebirikushemeza. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />Aryasingura ebigo by'amaani naahwerwa ruhanga otakamanywaga; kandi abarimwemera kuba abe aryabakuza n'ekitiinisa, abahindure abategyeki b'abaingi, ababaganisize ensi ahabw'enguzi.<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 11:27">Dan 11:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha bunaku bw'aha muheru omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo aryamuteera; kwonka omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho aryamusyokyera nk'akasooroora n'ebigaari n'ab'aha mbaraasi n'emeeri nyingi, ateere ensi, azishandaaremu nk'omwegyemure, azoogyemu; <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:9">Dan 8:9</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima ahikye omu nsi y'ekitiinisa. Obukumi n'obukumi baryaitwa, kwonka Abanyedomu, Abamoabu, n'abaingi b'omu Baamoni baryarokorwa omu mukono gwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />Aryabangira amahanga maingi omukono, n'ensi ya Misri terimukira. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />Aryagira obushoboorozi aha bintu ebibiikirwe, eby'ezaabu, eby'efeeza n'ebya Misri byona eby'obuguzi bwingi; kandi Abalibya n'Abanyesiopia baryagyenda bamukuratiire. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Kwonka bwanyima amakuru agariruga oburugwa-izooba n'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho garyamwemereza omutima, ahurure n'ekiniga kingi kuhwerekyereza baingi n'okubamariraho kimwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />Aryateera amahema ge g'obugabe ahagati y'enyanja n'orushozi orurikwera orw'ekitiinisa; kwonka aryahika aha muheru gw'amagara ge, ataine kihwera.<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Danieli okworekwa eby'aha mperu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:32">Kur 32:32</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 32:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:2">Yoel 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:19">Mak 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:20">Luk 10:20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">Kush 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:12">20:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo Mikaeli, omukuru rugambwa oreeberera abantu baawe, aryaimuka, habeho obunaku bw'obusaasi obutakabahoga, okwiha obu eihanga ryabaho okuhitsya obwo; kwonka omuri obwo bunaku abantu baawe baryajunwa, weena ou eiziina rye ririshangwa rihandiikirwe omu kitabo. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 17:15">Zab 17:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:19">Isa 26:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:1-10">Ezk 37:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:46">Mat 25:46</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:28">Yoh 5:28</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 5:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:11">11:11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 24:15">Byak 24:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:13">Kush 20:13</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baingi omuri abo, abariba bagwejegyeire omu mucuucu gw'ensi, baryasisiimuka, abamwe basisiimukire amagara agatahwaho, abandi basisiimukire okuhemuka n'okugaywa okutarihwaho. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:33">Dan 11:33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:43">Mat 13:43</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abaine obwengye baryayaka nk'omushana ogurikwakira omu mwanya, n'abarikuhindura baingi, bakabareeta omu kuhikiirira, baryayaka nk'enyonyoozi okuhitsya ryari na ryari. <verse eid="DAN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:17">Dan 8:17</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 8:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:16">Isa 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:11">29:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:10">Kush 22:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka iwe Danieli shweka ahari ebyo bigambo, ekitabo okiteerane n'akamanyiso, okuhitsya aha bunaku bw'aha mperu. Baingi baryairuka nibakora oku n'oku, n'okumanya kuryayeyongyera.<verse eid="DAN 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />Bwanyima nyowe Danieli, ku naayetegyereize, naareeba abandi babiri, omwe aha nkungu y'omugyera seenu, n'ondi aha nkungu y'omugyera seeri. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:13">Dan 8:13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:5">10:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 9:2">Ezk 9:2</ref>. </char></note> Omwe yaabuuza ori owaabaire ajwaire omwenda gwa kitaani, ari ahaiguru y'amaizi g'omugyera, ati: Eby'okutangaaza ebyo biryamara mwanya ki bitakahweireho? <verse eid="DAN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 8:24">8:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 14:22">Kut 14:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luk 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="REV 10:6">Kush 10:6</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mushaija, owaabaire ajwaire omwenda gwa kitaani ari ahaiguru y'amaizi, yaimutsya omukono gwe gwa buryo n'ogwa bumosho, naagyoreka ahaiguru; naahurira naarahira Ogwo otuura ahuriire ebiro byona, ngu biryamara obunaku n'obunaku bubiri n'ekicweka ky'obunaku; kandi ngu, ku bariheza kusheenyagura amaani g'eihanga eririkwera, ebyo byona biryahikiirira. <verse eid="DAN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Naabihurira, kwonka tinaabyetegyereza; nikwo kubuuza nti: Mukama wangye, ekirihereeruka omuri ebyo nikiiha? <verse eid="DAN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />Yaagira ati: Yegyendere, Danieli, ahabw'okuba ebigambo bishwekirwe, kandi byahamibwa n'akamanyiso, okuhitsya aha bunaku bw'aha mperu. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:33">Dan 11:33</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Kush 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:11">22:11</ref>. </char></note> Baingi baryayeshemeza, beeyeze, barabibwe omu iziiko; kwonka ababi baryagumizamu nibakora ebibi; kandi tihariho n'omwe omuri abo babi oribyetegyereza, kwonka abaine obwengye bo baryabyetegyereza. <verse eid="DAN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:31">Dan 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14">Mak 13:14</ref>. </char></note> Okwiha aha bunaku obu ekitambo ky'okwotsya eky'obutoosha kiriihirwaho, bakataho ekirikuzira ekirikuhwerekyereza, haryahinguraho ebiro rukumi na magana abiri na makumi mwenda. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:12">Yak 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:11">5:11</ref>. </char></note> Oritegyereza akahika aha kiro kya rukumi na magana ashatu na makumi ashatu na bitaano, aryaba ahiiriirwe. <verse eid="DAN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:39">Mat 13:39</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:11">Kush 6:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka yegyendere okuhitsya aha muheru; bwanyima oryahuumura, oyemerere omu mwanya ogwakuteereirweho, aha muheru gw'ebyo biro.<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>